<h2>Synopsis<a class="headerlink" href="#synopsis" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<div class="highlight-default notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span>  <span class="nb">list</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">aliases</span>
